>game,IW4MS

// Order matters here.
//
// The menu lists come first, and among them those carrying functionDef
// blocks. The dump writes the zone's shared function table into the lists it
// wrote, and the Linker makes a function available to every later menu once
// the list defining it has been parsed, but not before. A menu calling FUNC_29
// ahead of that definition fails with "Unknown function".

